      "type": "text",
      "text": "{\"id\":\"THE-622\",\"uuid\":\"c3fc775c-eff0-425e-80a0-ce9e4eaeaeb4\",\"title\":\"Handle typed native GraphQL failures and preserve forge fallback semantics\",\"description\":\"Audit baseline: f4c1355b, September 13 2026. Evidence: docs/audits/live-build-2026-09-13-review.md and linked specialist reviews.\\n\\nProblem and evidence\\n\\nPinned octocrab 0.54 converts GraphQL errors to Err before the existing successful-response errors check. Live Sage PR functionality logged 554 failures; auth/access cause remains unverified.\\n\\nAcceptance\\n\\nClassify typed errors, preserve intended CLI fallback, and keep repository/auth/server errors from marking global connectivity offline. Test partial errors, misleading message text, status classes and fallback call counts.\\n\\nRequired workflow: root-reviewed implementation plan, revisions and greenlight; code review and meaningful regression tests; independent adversarial review; reviewed local-main merge. Tests use isolated state. Mark done only when the required landing is complete.\\n\\n### September 13 remediation review checkpoint\\n\\nDiagnostics/forge candidate 6c6a12a5 plus reviewed portability revision: payload-free input logs, in-place connectivity updates, exact public-host native routing, typed GraphQL fallback, bounded helper output/lifetime/reaping and bounded source-aware diagnostic suppression. Primary review caught raw-key logging and reaping/signalling ownership holes; fixed before approval. Independent review required pre-spawn refusal of helper execution on platforms without bounded group termination. Forge24 and actual input-module13 tests passed; assembled final core logging16 and config-dedup4 tests now pass.\\n\\nCombined host test graph is now compiling once in an isolated review checkout. Independent adversarial source review found no remaining introduced Linux blockers after revisions; final execution gates remain pending. Canonical `.git` is read-only in this session, so no local-main merge or live upgrade has occurred. Issue remains In Progress pending required verification and landing.\\n\\nSeptember 14 local landing: reviewed candidate ea807922 is now merged into canonical local main, with signed landing receipt 407e7d77. All 99 earlier environment-blocked tests passed after unrestricted execution was enabled; exact failed-test-set coverage was independently verified. Post-merge ratchets/specification validation passed. The prior read-only/99-failure landing holds are superseded; this receipt does not claim closure of any separately documented residual acceptance item. No push or live restart occurred. Evidence: docs/audits/local-main-landing-2026-09-14.md.\",\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/blakeashley/issue/THE-622/handle-typed-native-graphql-failures-and-preserve-forge-fallback\",\"gitBranchName\":\"blake/the-622-handle-typed-native-graphql-failures-and-preserve-forge\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-14T03:33:12.741Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-09-14T23:01:43.228Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-14T03:33:12.872Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"1dad59ac-6f23-4363-95ca-f256f00ff767\",\"name\":\"In Progress\",\"type\":\"started\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-14T03:33:12.741Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Blake Ashley\",\"createdById\":\"3b7f5427-3d7f-40df-822c-6b4439a509e7\",\"project\":\"Alpha Reliability & State Compatibility\",\"projectId\":\"0936d19e-ad7f-4fb0-9e66-d64cbd8aed18\",\"parentId\":\"THE-614\",\"team\":\"Thegn\",\"teamId\":\"6d265c7c-ac1f-40c7-9983-f919d7b5d254\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[],\"blockedBy\":[],\"relatedTo\":[{\"id\":\"THE-638\",\"title\":\"Maintenance batch 03: task-manager performance and ten scoped bug acceptances\"}],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"
